rl":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106765.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-01T23:14:16Z"},"body":"As the Godot Arrays (script-language-wise) are effectively C# Lists, this PR implements `AddRange(ReadOnlySpan)` overloads to the corresponding C# wrapper type to match the same implementation in [CollectionExtensions.cs](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/87b35f477c09f146107a6c11627317f6b15e9d3e/src/libraries/System.Private.CoreLib/src/System/Collections/Generic/CollectionExtensions.cs#L96).\r\n\r\nThis also benefits existing codes, as all AddRange calls with collection expressions and arrays automatically bind to the new ROS overload (after recompilation). This removes GC-tracked objects (for collection expressions) or fewer virtual calls (for arrays).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106765/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106765/timeline","performed_via_gith